eceived are multiple fragments of tan white  unremarkable skin  ranging from REMOVED_DATE x 1 4cm to REMOVED_DATE x 0 4cm  Representative sections are submitted as follows   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative sections of biopsy cavity   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative sections of hemorrhagic focus   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Tissue intervening between the biopsy cavity and hemorrhagic focus   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative sections of skin fragments   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID     lymph nodes  Final Diagnosis by Melinda J Lerwill M D   Electronically signed on Thursday REMOVED_MONTH 19   REMOVED_CASE_ID  at 06 54 04PM By his her signature above  the pathologist listed as making the Final Diagnosis certifies that he she has personally reviewed this case and confirmed or corrected the diagnoses  PART   Breast  Right   Simple Mastectomy  report_end  , Negative.
